From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 01:20:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 29/66] wifi-scripts: write the RADIUS accounting server once

iface_accounting_server() ran twice for an 802.1X BSS without an
internal EAP server: inside iface_auth_type()'s eap branch, next to
iface_authentication_server(), and again unconditionally in generate().
Each run appends acct_server_addr/port/secret and radius_acct_req_attr,
so hostapd kept two accounting server entries and put every
radius_acct_req_attr (a NAS-Identifier, say) into each
Accounting-Request twice, where RFC 2866 allows it once.

Keep the unconditional call, which also serves non-EAP networks that
use RADIUS accounting, and drop the one in the eap branch. Seen on an
Arista C-260: 1 auth_server_addr but 2 acct_server_addr and 2
radius_acct_req_attr per 802.1X radio config; 1 each with this change.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
---
 package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile                    | 2 +-
 .../config/wifi-scripts/files-ucode/usr/share/ucode/wifi/ap.uc  | 1 -
 2 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile
index 5637a82ef8..e3e1b8860a 100644
--- a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile
+++ b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/Makefile
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@ include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
 PKG_NAME:=wifi-scripts
 PKG_VERSION:=1.0
-PKG_RELEASE:=4
+PKG_RELEASE:=5
 PKG_LICENSE:=GPL-2.0
 
 PKG_MAINTAINER:=Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
diff --git a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files-ucode/usr/share/ucode/wifi/ap.uc b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files-ucode/usr/share/ucode/wifi/ap.uc
index 3afc20006f..c1f4cd38f5 100644
--- a/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files-ucode/usr/share/ucode/wifi/ap.uc
+++ b/package/network/config/wifi-scripts/files-ucode/usr/share/ucode/wifi/ap.uc
@@ -342,7 +342,6 @@ function iface_auth_type(config, band, eht) {
 
 		if (!config.eap_server) {
 			iface_authentication_server(config);
-			iface_accounting_server(config);
 		}
 
 		if (config.radius_das_client && config.radius_das_secret) {
